y>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, AKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUPER LINE CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKUHARA, EIJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKUHARA EIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, AKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKUHARA, EIJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of repairing a sheet metal (14) of a car body (10), comprising the steps of removing a damaged part, folding down a portion near the end part of a repair member (22) to which the damaged part is connected or a portion near the end part of the sheet metal using a sheet metal repair tool, and connecting the portion near the end part of the repair member to the portion near the end part of the sheet metal (14).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé pour réparer le métal en feuille (14) d'une carrosserie de voiture (10) qui consiste à retirer la partie endommagée, à replier une partie située près du bout d'un élément de réparation (22) auquel est reliée la partie endommagée ou une partie située près du bout du métal en feuille au moyen d'un outil de réparation de métal en feuille et à relier la partie située près du bout de l'élément de réparation à la partie située près du bout du métal en feuille (14).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>